    js "哦……我以为这是候补名单上被录取的学生的常见名字。"

# game/update4.rpy:1489
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_3ea6cbdb:

    # ji "Haha! I think you mean replacements, not rejects."
    ji "哈哈！我认为你的意思是替换，而不是拒绝。"

# game/update4.rpy:1491
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_1c13bfa0:

    # js "Oh!"
    js "哦！"

# game/update4.rpy:1492
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_ba725360:

    # js "It was my stepbrother who taught me that saying. Sorry."
    js "这句话是我继兄教我的。对不起。"

# game/update4.rpy:1493
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_5b5b60ba:

    # js "I'm Josy, by the way."
    js "顺便说一下，我是Josy。"

# game/update4.rpy:1495
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_3569b29a:

    # ji "Jill. Nice to meet you."
    ji "Jill.很高兴见到你。"

# game/update4.rpy:1496
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_6c4975eb:

    # ji "Welcome to B&R!"
    ji "欢迎来到贝加莱！"

# game/update4.rpy:1498
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_896ae8bf:

    # js "Hey, thanks!"
    js "嘿，谢谢！"

# game/update4.rpy:1499
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_1b343148:

    # js "Are you also a freshman?"
    js "你也是一年级新生吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1501
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_4271d4d0:

    # ji "No, I'm a third-year student. I've just been postponing this class for as long as possible."
    ji "不，我是三年级学生。我只是尽可能推迟这门课。"

# game/update4.rpy:1503
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_e1954327:

    # js "It's not a fun class?"
    js "这不是一堂有趣的课吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1505
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_ff07d751:

    # ji "Financial Crisis? No, not really."
    ji "金融危机？不，不是真的。"

# game/update4.rpy:1506
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_cbe8ff41:

    # ji "It's probably ok, but there are so many more interesting classes out there."
    ji "这可能没问题，但是还有很多更有趣的课程。"

# game/update4.rpy:1507
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_faec344d:

    # ji "You'll see."
    ji "你会看到的。"

# game/update4.rpy:1509
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_1caa564d:

    # ji "Are you ok? You look a bit tense."
    ji "你还好吗？你看起来有点紧张。"

# game/update4.rpy:1511
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_1ede2a33:

    # js "It's just first day nerves."
    js "这只是第一天的紧张。"

# game/update4.rpy:1512
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_2d845c22:

    # js "Plus, I feel a bit lost since I missed orientation."
    js "另外，由于错过了迎新活动，我感到有点失落。"

# game/update4.rpy:1514
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_07495d60:

    # ji "I remember the first day jitters."
    ji "我记得第一天的紧张。"

# game/update4.rpy:1515
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_e44b319e:

    # ji "If you'd like, I can show you around afterwards?"
    ji "如果您愿意的话，之后我可以带您参观一下吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1517
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_86ad9bce:

    # js "(Hm... Maya promised me that she would...but I could be making a new friend this way.)"
    js "（嗯……Maya答应我她会……但我可以通过这种方式结交新朋友。）"

# game/update4.rpy:1519
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_3ba35308:

    # js "Sure! I would love that!"
    js "当然！我会喜欢的！"

# game/update4.rpy:1521
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_5e25660f:

    # ji "What other classes are you signed up for?"
    ji "您还报名参加了哪些其他课程？"

# game/update4.rpy:1523
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_5c493419:

    # js "English and Math, you know, Gen. Ed. classes."
    js "英语和数学，你知道，埃德将军。类。"

# game/update4.rpy:1525
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_3848ada7:

    # ji "That's smart doing those early or you'll end up like me, postponing the less interesting ones."
    ji "尽早做这些事情是明智的，否则你最终会像我一样，推迟那些不太有趣的事情。"

# game/update4.rpy:1527
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_3a8b3562:

    # js "You have the class literature already? Are we supposed to have that?"
    js "你已经有班级文献了吗？我们应该有那个吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1529
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_d1f6aa35:

    # ji "No, you're fine. You got here a bit later than everyone else and teachers understand that."
    ji "不，你很好。你比其他人来得晚一点，老师也明白这一点。"

# game/update4.rpy:1530
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_04110056:

    # ji "By the way, the library sells class literature and my best friend works there."
    ji "顺便说一句，图书馆出售阶级文学，我最好的朋友在那里工作。"

# game/update4.rpy:1531
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_122a7340:

    # ji "I can set you up with a copy if you'd like?"
    ji "如果您愿意的话，我可以给您一份副本？"

# game/update4.rpy:1533
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_4c1c52c9:

    # js "That would be awesome. I feel like my brain is overflowing with information and impressions already."
    js "那太棒了。我觉得我的大脑已经充满了信息和印象。"

# game/update4.rpy:1535
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_5dc8400b:

    # ji "We can share it today."
    ji "今天我们可以分享一下。"

# game/update4.rpy:1537
translate schinese ep4_eco_label_3b38c967:

    # js "All right."
    js "好的。"

# game/update4.rpy:1544
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_86531b3c:

    # mg "You're asking me for permission to humiliate one of us in front of your chums for Hell Week?"
    mg "你是在请求我允许你在地狱周当着你的朋友的面羞辱我们中的一个人吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1545
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_745075fa:

    # mg "Did I understand that correctly?"
    mg "我理解正确吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1550
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_553e11be:

    # mc "Those weren't my words."
    mc "这不是我说的。"

# game/update4.rpy:1555
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_81d7ab27:

    # mg "Hell Week is so gruesome in your fraternities."
    mg "你们兄弟会的地狱周真是太可怕了。"

# game/update4.rpy:1556
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_8ee17e84:

    # mg "The tri-alphas have their \"butt beer\", \"nerd puncher\" and \"skank hunt\"..."
    mg "三阿尔法有他们的“屁股啤酒”、“书呆子拳击手”和“臭鼬狩猎”......"

# game/update4.rpy:1557
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_f70a56f8:

    # mg "...you have your pledge board..."
    mg "...你有你的承诺板..."

# game/update4.rpy:1558
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_9a5030a6:

    # mg "...and who knows what's going on in the Alpha Nu Omega mansion with their Dante week or whatever they tried naming it."
    mg "...谁知道 Alpha Nu Omega 豪宅里发生了什么事，他们的但丁周或者他们试图命名的任何东西。"

# game/update4.rpy:1563
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_2532aa7f:

    # mc "What's the tri-betas' tradition?"
    mc "三贝塔的传统是什么？"

# game/update4.rpy:1565
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_7ff67ce4:

    # mg "We engage in nightly games of Dungeons and Gremlins and review the new recruits' intelligence in various forms of tests."
    mg "我们每晚都会进行《地下城与小魔怪》的游戏，并通过各种形式的测试来审查新兵的智力。"

# game/update4.rpy:1566
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_6a925409:

    # mg "It's a much more friendly environment for a freshman."
    mg "对于新生来说，这是一个更加友好的环境。"

# game/update4.rpy:1568
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_d2d0abf5:

    # mc "What can I say? Different strokes..."
    mc "我能说什么？不同的笔画..."

# game/update4.rpy:1570
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_fe9ff561:

    # mg "Different indeed."
    mg "确实不同。"

# game/update4.rpy:1571
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_4083aab4:

    # mg "*{i}Sigh{/i}* Are you guys bullying the other fraternities as well or is it just us who are your punching bag?"
    mg "*{i}Sigh{/i}* 你们也欺负其他兄弟会还是只有我们才是你们的出气筒？"

# game/update4.rpy:1573
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_e07dc354:

    # mc "No, it's not just you guys."
    mc "不，不仅仅是你们。"

# game/update4.rpy:1574
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_9b8c07a4:

    # mc "We're pranking the other frats, too."
    mc "我们也在恶作剧其他兄弟会。"

# game/update4.rpy:1576
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_dcbd2837:

    # mg "Haha. That's nice to hear."
    mg "哈哈。很高兴听到这个消息。"

# game/update4.rpy:1579
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_fc0f5717:

    # mc "Hey, it wasn't me who wrote that task on the pledge board."
    mc "嘿，那个任务不是我写在承诺板上的。"

# game/update4.rpy:1581
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_ab414d55:

    # mc "Look, I'm sorry. I didn't write that task on the pledge board."
    mc "听着，我很抱歉。我没有把那个任务写在承诺板上。"

# game/update4.rpy:1583
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_0f183c54:

    # mg "No, I fully grasp the situation. You're just the marionette..."
    mg "不，我完全了解情况。你只是一个提线木偶……"

# game/update4.rpy:1584
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_194ab1d4:

    # mg "...at least for this semester."
    mg "...至少在这个学期是这样。"

# game/update4.rpy:1585
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_5b70fd24:

    # mg "I can't give you the permission to do what you ask."
    mg "我不能允许你做你要求做的事。"

# game/update4.rpy:1586
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_decadb55:

    # mg "And I'd rather not see it be done against our will."
    mg "我不希望看到它违背我们的意愿而进行。"

# game/update4.rpy:1588
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_20d21357:

    # mg "But...like the years before..."
    mg "但是……就像几年前一样……"

# game/update4.rpy:1589
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_f7df6a7f:

    # mg "Saying no would be the definition of insanity."
    mg "说“不”就是疯狂的定义。"

# game/update4.rpy:1590
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_2c009ca8:

    # mg "I'll be the martyr for your mission..."
    mg "我将成为你使命的烈士......"

# game/update4.rpy:1591
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_b3ff8122:

    # mg "...for {color=#36ca2b}$${/color}."
    mg "...对于 {color=#36ca2b}$${/color}。"

# game/update4.rpy:1598
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_83a7a264:

    # mc "Ok, I can do that."
    mc "好的，我可以做到。"

# game/update4.rpy:1601
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_7976fe2f:

    # mg "Now what happens? Do we find your friends first?"
    mg "现在会发生什么？我们先找到你的朋友吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1603
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_dc2cc013:

    # mc "We could just record it on my phone right here."
    mc "我们可以把它记录在我的手机上。"

# game/update4.rpy:1604
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_d2514736:

    # mc "It would be less humiliating and over in a minute."
    mc "这样就不那么丢脸了，一分钟就结束了。"

# game/update4.rpy:1606
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_47b95bdf:

    # mg "*{i}Mumbles{/i}* Less humiliating, he says."
    mg "*{i}Mumbles{/i}* 少一些羞辱，他说。"

# game/update4.rpy:1607
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_7b39a248:

    # mg "Ok. Go ahead."
    mg "好的。前进。"

# game/update4.rpy:1614
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_8bc970ef:

    # mc "Never mind. This was a stupid idea."
    mc "没关系。这是一个愚蠢的想法。"

# game/update4.rpy:1619
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_6da2dce5:

    # mg "Then I'll fear the future to come."
    mg "然后我就会害怕未来的到来。"

# game/update4.rpy:1626
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_aa520d65:

    # mc "You'll have nothing to fear from me. I was just looking for an easy way out."
    mc "你不会有什么好害怕的。我只是想寻找一个简单的出路。"

# game/update4.rpy:1627
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_a1b197a2:

    # mc "I'm not going to give you or your friends a wedgie."
    mc "我不会给你或你的朋友结婚。"

# game/update4.rpy:1628
translate schinese ep4_magnar_label_523b58d3:

    # mc "I know what that feels like."
    mc "我知道那是什么感觉。"

# game/update4.rpy:1635
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_3529f7f0:

    # js "Thank you so much!"
    js "太感谢了！"

# game/update4.rpy:1637
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_362b063d:

    # isa "You're welcome."
    isa "不客气。"

# game/update4.rpy:1638
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_70e23b11:

    # isa "You can always come to me if you need any help."
    isa "如果您需要任何帮助，可以随时来找我。"

# game/update4.rpy:1640
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_f7b78902:

    # js "Your friend is very sweet and helpful."
    js "你的朋友非常友善且乐于助人。"

# game/update4.rpy:1641
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_78aab6be:

    # ji "Yeah, Bella is the best."
    ji "是的，Bella是最棒的。"

# game/update4.rpy:1643
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_96480d15:

    # isa "Are you two done?"
    isa "你们两个忙完了吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1645
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_a6ff93a3:

    # ji "And she has a hard time accepting compliments."
    ji "她很难接受赞美。"

# game/update4.rpy:1646
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_def1b7b3:

    # js "Haha!"
    js "哈哈！"

# game/update4.rpy:1648
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_71e3489a:

    # ji "Do you want to look around in the library or go grab some lunch?"
    ji "你想去图书馆看看还是去吃午饭？"

# game/update4.rpy:1650
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_640a3d49:

    # js "Whatever you think, I'm just happy you're giving me a tour."
    js "不管你怎么想，我很高兴你带我参观。"

# game/update4.rpy:1652
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_53689fff:

    # ji "Then let's do lunch, I'm getting hungry."
    ji "那我们去吃午饭吧，我饿了。"

# game/update4.rpy:1654
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_71be0aa3:

    # ji "Bella? Will you join us?"
    ji "Bella？你愿意加入我们吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1655
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_2e4db0ec:

    # isa "I'll go get my purse."
    isa "我去拿我的钱包。"

# game/update4.rpy:1660
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_22a6b1f7:

    # mc "(Josy!? No... Not with Jill.)"
    mc "（Josy！？不……不和Jill一起。）"

# game/update4.rpy:1662
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_e22cf9d0:

    # ji "Excuse me for a minute."
    ji "打扰一下。"

# game/update4.rpy:1663
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_8c797edf:

    # ji "[name]!"
    ji "[name]！"

# game/update4.rpy:1665
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_7e890f26:

    # ji "Hey, I'm glad I ran into you."
    ji "嘿，我很高兴遇见你。"

# game/update4.rpy:1666
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_2156abbb:

    # ji "How are you?"
    ji "你好吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1667
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_6cc90574:

    # mc "I'm...ok."
    mc "我可以。"

# game/update4.rpy:1669
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_e1711965:

    # ji "Listen, I didn't want to ask you this over the phone..."
    ji "听着，我不想通过电话问你这个......"

# game/update4.rpy:1670
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_5b420ad8:

    # ji "...it feels so impersonal."
    ji "……感觉太没有人情味了。"

# game/update4.rpy:1671
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_1e8e5f4a:

    # ji "I was going to ask you if you're up for that date tomorrow afternoon?"
    ji "我正想问你明天下午的约会是否合适？"

# game/update4.rpy:1673
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_9f14ba60:

    # js "(A date...?)"
    js "（约会……？）"

# game/update4.rpy:1675
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_901e9781:

    # mc "Um...yeah. That works."
    mc "嗯...是的。那行得通。"

# game/update4.rpy:1677
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_2c557890:

    # ji "I didn't mean to put you on the spot, but I've been thinking about something I wanted to show you..."
    ji "我不是故意让你难堪的，但我一直在想一些我想给你看的东西......"

# game/update4.rpy:1678
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_1b2187bf:

    # ji "...and tomorrow is a perfect day for it. It's supposed to be sunny."
    ji "...明天是完美的一天。应该是晴天。"

# game/update4.rpy:1680
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_d2c80bad:

    # mc "Where are we going?"
    mc "我们要去哪里？"

# game/update4.rpy:1682
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_44678c99:

    # ji "I'll send you the address later. Meet me there at 3 p.m. and I'll show you."
    ji "稍后我会把地址发给你。下午 3 点在那里见我。我会告诉你。"

# game/update4.rpy:1684
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_44ddff90:

    # ji "Oh, I'm so rude!"
    ji "噢，我真是太粗鲁了！"

# game/update4.rpy:1686
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_157abb21:

    # ji "Josy! I would like you to meet [name]."
    ji "Josy！我想让你认识[name]。"

# game/update4.rpy:1687
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_8046d347:

    # ji "He's a...um...friend of mine."
    ji "他是我的……嗯……朋友。"

# game/update4.rpy:1689
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_790dbae7:

    # js "He's actually a...friend of mine, too."
    js "他实际上也是我的...朋友。"

# game/update4.rpy:1691
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_4a0d94c7:

    # ji "What a surprise! So, you know each other from before?"
    ji "真是一个惊喜！那么，你们以前就认识吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1692
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_164117cb:

    # ji "Did you go to school together?"
    ji "你们一起上学吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1694
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_1f6559a1:

    # js "No, we worked together this summer in a minimart."
    js "不，今年夏天我们在一家小超市一起工作。"

# game/update4.rpy:1696
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_7fd7969e:

    # ji "That makes me happy to hear."
    ji "这让我很高兴听到。"

# game/update4.rpy:1697
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_1f29a9a9:

    # ji "I'm sure we all will get along together great, then."
    ji "我确信我们大家都会相处得很好。"

# game/update4.rpy:1699
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_6ca7bd67:

    # ji "We were just going to get lunch. Do you want to join us?"
    ji "我们正要去吃午饭。你想加入我们吗？"

# game/update4.rpy:1701
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_1bf4ddd7:

    # mc "Sorry, I have plans."
    mc "抱歉，我有计划。"

# game/update4.rpy:1703
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_ce334420:

    # ji "That's fine. I'll see you tomorrow, then."
    ji "没关系。那么明天见。"

# game/update4.rpy:1705
translate schinese ep4_jj_label_8d8683c2:

    # mc "Yeah... See you."
    mc "是的...再见。"

# game/update4.rpy:1715
translate schinese ep4_date_app_label_ff9832db:

    # jac "Haha! Crabs?"
    jac "哈哈！螃蟹？"

# game/update4.rpy:1716
translate schinese ep4_date_app_label_5e54e474:

    # jac "Both of you?"
    jac "你们两个？"

# game/update4.rpy:1718
translate schinese ep4_date_app_label_201b0ee0:

